summary.label:
CrocoMath is a great application for our kids to have a lot of fun with mathematics and at the same time to easily learn and improve their overall skills with math tables.

The application uses an approach that encourages learning. If the kids needs help to solve an exercise they can touch Croco, their math teacher, to ask for an hint and they’ll get a big jump on learning the basic arithmetic, while enjoying every second of that education experience.

You'll be surprised to receive requests to do more math exercises from your child!

Some features:
* math matching game to memorize and learn the math tables;
* 40 flash cards to learn math tables;
* timer mode;
* very simple design, ideal for our kids;
* simple enough to encourage kids to keep trying;
* exciting vibrant colors, in HD for iPad;
* simple and immediate user interface, specifically designated for this purpose;
* numbers are big and easily visible to kids;
* expressly and exclusively designed for the iPad with use of the finger touch features to control the game.

Thanks for using our products. Feedback is always welcome to: support@dighentis.com
App Store reviews are greatly appreciated, thank you.
